{"id":"84ea4126ac2ab144","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-coanalytic-perfect.md","title":"Coanalytic Perfect Set Property","display":"thm-coanalytic-perfect — Coanalytic Perfect Set Property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-coanalytic-perfect","aliases":["58-thm-coanalytic-perfect"],"display":"thm-coanalytic-perfect — Coanalytic Perfect Set Property","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md]]","[[58-df-perfect.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-coanalytic-perfect"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-coanalytic-perfect</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-coanalytic-perfect — Coanalytic Perfect Set Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a89278846ca9cc1\" href=\"?note=0a89278846ca9cc1\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md\">../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" href=\"?note=f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" title=\"58-df-perfect.md\">58-df-perfect.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,P\\in V\">\\(A,P\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,|x-y|\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\}\">\\(d_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,|x-y|\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the ambient-metric perfect-set predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}perfect}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}(A)\n\\land |A|&gt;\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}perfect}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}(A)\n\\land |A|&gt;\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原断言使用的 Perfect_S 允许空完美集；因此此断言保留原有较弱含义，不据此主张存在非空完美子集。</li>\n<li>The perfectness predicate is tied to the Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> rather than an unspecified ambient metric space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"0a89278846ca9cc1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-perfect.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6afc84fe5b2b44e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-perfect.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,|x-y|\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}perfect}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R}(A)\n\\land |A|>\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4082","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-coanalytic-perfect.md|58-thm-coanalytic-perfect]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["0a89278846ca9cc1","f6afc84fe5b2b44e","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}